## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a small, end-to-end event-driven analytics pipeline using core Azure primitives, plus governance and basic CI/CD, suitable for beginners.

## Key Concepts
- Event Grid integration with Functions
- Cosmos DB SQL API partitioning
- Function security with API key
- Lightweight Azure Policy tagging
- GitHub Actions for CI/CD

